{"articleNo":"244461","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=244461&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [생활관] 학사력 변경에 따른 생활관비 추가 납부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.11.03","hit":"11262","attachments":[{"name":"학사력 변경에 따른 생활관비 추가 납부 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=244461&attachNo=93675"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><br></div><div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\">학사력 변경에 따른 생활관비 추가 납부 안내를 첨부파일과 같이 안내합니다.<br></p></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">추가 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2020.12.19.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 09:00 ~ 12.26.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 09:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">거주 관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">호실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">현재 거주하는 관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">호실에서 거주</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">식사선택</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">식사선택 변경 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">현재 선택된 식사와 동일하게 적용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">생활관비 납부기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">: 2020.11.11.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">) ~ 11.13.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">매일&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">10:00 ~ 16:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">※ 납부 기간 내 미납 시, 자동 탈락이며 추후 신청기간 없음</span><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 25.6pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -25.6pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">생활관비 납부방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">원스톱서비스에서 고지서 출력하여 가상계좌로 납부</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"11359\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 25.6pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -25.6pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">원스톱서비스&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">–&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">학생지원&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">–&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">생활관&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">–&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">생활관결과확인&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"